From 307da3452f9961ae85b66183246a8f3228005991 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Work Leaf Bench <bench@example.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 16:06:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD prompt slash routing so selected agents receive
 commands

WorkLeafController remembers the selected session and routes slash-prefixed non-space command input through send_message when an agent is selected. The terminal adapter mirrors that selected-agent path while keeping slash-space input and command-row input on the Work Leaf command surface.
